    scope: "Orientation guide for Ford 4.6L Modular V8 timing systems. It is not a substitute for the workshop procedure selected by VIN, year, vehicle, valve count, cylinder-head casting, cam phaser type and replacement-part number. Vehicle-specific 2V, 3V and 4V interactive diagrams are still needed before this page can serve as a complete repair reference.",
