          "The links are not permanent running timing indicators. Because the chain length and sprocket tooth counts do not bring every marked link back to every timing mark after one or two crank rotations, judging a completed engine only by link color can create a false failure. Verify the mechanical crank/cam relationship and tool fit as Ford specifies.",
