    detail: "The factory LS7 joint uses ten M11 main bolts and five M8 upper bolts per bank. All are replaced during assembly. Clean and dry every blind hole, verify the 7.0L displacement marking and gasket direction, use an angle meter for both rotation passes, and follow a different specification if studs, aftermarket bolts, nonproduction heads or a modified block are installed.",
